    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. so looking at the efficiency side of things, all those massive companies provide such seamless products because of how huge they are. if the gov actually breaks them up, don't they basically just end up destroying the very ecosystems that make tech so useful for everyone? like, isn't the main risk of antitrust actually just destroying consumer value and making everything more fragmented and worse?",
